                "text": "There are serious concerns about xAI\u2019s gas turbines in South Memphis\u2014emissions, health risks, and a lack of transparency.\n\nToday I shared my concerns in a public letter to the SCHD. No company should get a free pass to pollute\u2014especially not one owned by Trump\u2019s top donor & the richest man on earth.",
