                "text": "The GOP are calling 1 in 8 Medicaid recipients \u201cwaste, fraud, and abuse\" as an excuse to cut hundreds of billions from the program. But a former CMS chief says the real fraud isn't from recipients\u2014it's from health companies overbilling.\n\nIt\u2019s not about waste, it's about making the rich even richer.",
