                "text": "The GOP are taking food and health care from the poor so the richest people alive can get even richer.\n\nThis may be the most morally repugnant bill Congress has ever produced. It will devastate people in Memphis, TN-9, and beyond.\n\nI voted HELL NO. I\u2019ll keep fighting this cruelty with everything I've got.",
